    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is Christmas Eve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got off of work for the holidays and are excited to spend time with your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning home you realise that your family is missing and all kinds of evil is all over your house! In this first person point and click adventure you are thrown into having to figure out how to cleanse this evil and save your family, and save Christmas! Think you are up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate the house to create positive holiday cheer that will combat the evil!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/9017293d78d060b04bbac53cf60eb552.poster.avif?t=1735144578\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/9017293d78d060b04bbac53cf60eb552.webm?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/9017293d78d060b04bbac53cf60eb552.mp4?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for remains to help cleanse the evil!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/bc4669641905f4c835747b72cadc700b.poster.avif?t=1735144578\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/bc4669641905f4c835747b72cadc700b.webm?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/bc4669641905f4c835747b72cadc700b.mp4?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the environment in many ways!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/594978da7ea0e48a5afc95869064a7bf.poster.avif?t=1735144578\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/594978da7ea0e48a5afc95869064a7bf.webm?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/594978da7ea0e48a5afc95869064a7bf.mp4?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is Christmas Eve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got off of work for the holidays and are excited to spend time with your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning home you realise that your family is missing and all kinds of evil is all over your house! In this first person point and click adventure you are thrown into having to figure out how to cleanse this evil and save your family, and save Christmas! Think you are up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate the house to create positive holiday cheer that will combat the evil!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/9017293d78d060b04bbac53cf60eb552.poster.avif?t=1735144578\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/9017293d78d060b04bbac53cf60eb552.webm?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/9017293d78d060b04bbac53cf60eb552.mp4?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for remains to help cleanse the evil!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/bc4669641905f4c835747b72cadc700b.poster.avif?t=1735144578\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/bc4669641905f4c835747b72cadc700b.webm?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385400/extras/bc4669641905f4c835747b72cadc700b.mp4?t=1735144578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>